{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/extras/0fbba308d672b334cd04f2ad508ffac1.avif?t=1767114592\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Some people are heroes. And some people jot down notes ... Sometimes they're the same person.&quot; \u2014 Terry Pratchett, <i>The Truth</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/extras/480fe8744c3338be48aac6c49b30c1e8.poster.avif?t=1767114592\" aria-label=\"A GIF showing the process of editing a newspaper, starting with removing all the currente articles on the page, then putting the news about the mayor&#039;s scandal onto the page, and finally making it as big as the front page, revealing in the process an image of the rooster mayor under the headline.\" width=1600 height=686 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/extras/480fe8744c3338be48aac6c49b30c1e8.webm?t=1767114592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/extras/480fe8744c3338be48aac6c49b30c1e8.mp4?t=1767114592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have limited space in your newspaper. What will you print, what will you bury?\u00a0Increase the size of news stories to attract more readers and sway their beliefs. Increase the size of Ads to make more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you print has a consequence and will change your world in myriad ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/extras/abdb7e28958a53d2f0f8b5a451ba82b5.avif?t=1767114592\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u201cJournalism could be described as turning one's enemies into money.&quot; \u2014 Craig Brown</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/extras/496959f1a52949e96f120f5a6631bae6.poster.avif?t=1767114592\" aria-label=\"A GIF showing the process of assigning a reporter to a special location. Lake Gorgo pops up as a location on the map and the player drags the mole rat reporter from the tray on the left onto the location, revealing some writen details about the location in the process.\" width=1600 height=686 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/extras/496959f1a52949e96f120f5a6631bae6.webm?t=1767114592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/extras/496959f1a52949e96f120f5a6631bae6.mp4?t=1767114592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and guide your reporters; choose how they spin each story! Your paper is a business, so keep an eye on your competition and your profit margins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must climb those Sales Charts if you want to stay relevant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/extras/1c434410146c91ebd36f979745fad0ac.avif?t=1767114592\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Four hostile newspapers are more to be feared than a thousand bayonets.&quot;\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2014\u00a0Napoleon Bonaparte</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/extras/064ff20eadf326393bd6b3c76ce5477e.avif?t=1767114592\" width=1560 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Codavia, where every creature has an agenda, and your pen is a loaded weapon. Your choices shape the city, its elections, its stories, and your inbox full of threats, bribes, and lawsuits.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of newspaper will you create, and how will you change your world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/extras/6902536ac302c9459a238e414e20e7d6.avif?t=1767114592\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u201cIf you don't read the newspaper, you're uninformed. If you read the newspaper, you're mis-informed.\u201d \u2014 Mark Twain</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/extras/a0922c6f8195c7bec77bf865fc4acd9d.poster.avif?t=1767114592\" aria-label=\"A GIF showing a mole rat reporter asking the player how to report the mayor&#039;s rally speech. The player selects &amp;quot;Mock his gaffes&amp;quot;. The GIF cuts to an angry rooster mayor reaction shouting some censored explitives and asking to see his lawyer.\" width=1600 height=686 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/extras/a0922c6f8195c7bec77bf865fc4acd9d.webm?t=1767114592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/extras/a0922c6f8195c7bec77bf865fc4acd9d.mp4?t=1767114592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truth is complicated, and easily manipulated. The stories you tell and how you choose to tell them will determine the truth of your world and the fates of its creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 4 different victory types, 5 early game overs and 30+ different endings, each playthrough lets you uncover your own unique truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868010?t=1767114592","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868010?t=1767114592","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/fd33254dd69076a54bcc46e8286c0dbe4d92ff94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767114592","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/fd33254dd69076a54bcc46e8286c0dbe4d92ff94/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767114592","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains some textual descriptions and insinuations of murder, political scandals, mass riots, war crimes, as well as an interactable cigarette."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868010/extras/0fbba308d672b334cd04f2ad508ffac1.avif?t=1767114592\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Some people are heroes. And some people jot down notes ... Sometimes they're the same person.&quot; \u2014 Terry 